WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:04.300
A busy high street has just
2 shops selling phone cases.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.960
Then 4 more sellers open nearby,

3
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.120
chasing the same shoppers.

4
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.250
Somewhere else, a drug company
holds a patent on a new medicine.

5
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.890
For up to 20 years,

6
00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.990
no rival may copy it.

7
00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.010
Why do prices fall when
rival sellers arrive,

8
00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:23.010
and what happens when
only one firm is left?

9
00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.590
In this mission, you'll
add sellers to a market

10
00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:28.460
in a graph lab, and predict the new price.

11
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:32.510
Then you'll meet the barriers
that keep rivals out of a market.

12
00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:36.290
Your mission: explain what
competition does to prices,

13
00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:37.960
and what changes without it.
